# NOTE: the leading slashes matter. Git's ignore matching is case-insensitive on
# Windows (core.ignorecase = true), so an unanchored "Data/" ALSO matches
# "public/data/" and silently excludes the map's own GeoJSON. Anchor to the repo
# root so only the top-level folders are ignored.

# Raw survey deliverables (135 MB of redundant KMZ revisions + full-res
# originals). The map serves the derived, web-sized output in public/ instead;
# rebuild it with `npm run build:data` against a local copy of Data/.
/Data/

# Reference copy of the internal Jonah Operations Map source, kept locally to
# match its styling. Contains Entra ID client/tenant IDs and internal API
# routes -- must not be published.
/examples/

/_work/
node_modules/
.vercel
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
